  "p065": {"id":"p065","segments":[{"t":0,"x":"George Washington had many great "},{"t":1,"x":"successes","ki":0},{"t":2,"x":"（成功；成就）"},{"t":0,"x":" in his life, but he didn't "},{"t":1,"x":"succeed","ki":1},{"t":2,"x":"（成功；达成目标）"},{"t":0,"x":" in keeping his "},{"t":1,"x":"own","ki":2},{"t":2,"x":"（自己的）"},{"t":0,"x":" teeth! Back then, many people "},{"t":1,"x":"lost","ki":3},{"t":2,"x":"（迷路的；丢失的）"},{"t":0,"x":" their teeth, But "},{"t":1,"x":"modern","ki":4},{"t":2,"x":"（现代的；近代的）"},{"t":0,"x":" people know how to protecttheir teeth The most important thing is to "},{"t":1,"x":"brush","ki":5},{"t":2,"x":"（刷子；画笔）"},{"t":0,"x":" your teeth By keeping the teeth clean you will not have a "},{"t":1,"x":"toothache","ki":6},{"t":2,"x":"（牙痛）"},{"t":0,"x":" or other tooth "},{"t":1,"x":"disease","ki":7},{"t":2,"x":"（疾病）"},{"t":0,"x":" One other important thing is to eat right. For example, milk and cheese give teeth "},{"t":1,"x":"calcium","ki":8},{"t":2,"x":"（钙）"},{"t":0,"x":",which they need to be strong. Fruits andvegetables also help by "},{"t":1,"x":"providing","ki":9},{"t":2,"x":"（提供；供应）"},{"t":0,"x":" VA and VD. On the other hand, sweet food is bad for teeth So "},{"t":1,"x":"brush","ki":10},{"t":2,"x":"（刷子；画笔）"},{"t":0,"x":" your teeth and eat right. They are thebasicthings you "},{"t":1,"x":"should","ki":11},{"t":2,"x":"（应该；应当）"},{"t":0,"x":" do to "},{"t":1,"x":"protect","ki":12},{"t":2,"x":"（保护；防护）"},{"t":0,"x":" your teeth.If you do the things, you'll be "},{"t":1,"x":"able","ki":13},{"t":2,"x":"（能够的）"},{"t":0,"x":" to have good teeth for your wholelife. That’s one "},{"t":1,"x":"success","ki":14},{"t":2,"x":"（成功；成就）"},{"t":0,"x":" that even George Washington didn't have!"}],"zhLines":["乔治·华盛顿在他的一生中取得很多成功，但他却没有成功保养好自己的牙齿！那时很多人的牙齿都脱落了。但现代人知道如何保护牙齿。","最重要的事是刷牙。让牙齿保持清洁，你就不会害牙疼或得其他牙病。","另一件重要的事是正确饮食。例如，牛奶和奶酪可以提供钙，牙齿要坚硬需要钙。水果和蔬菜提供的维A和维D也对牙齿有帮助。另一方面，甜的食物对牙齿有害。","因此，要刷牙、正确饮食。要保护牙齿，这些是你应做的基本的事情。如果你这样做，你的一生都会拥有好牙齿，那可是乔治·华盛顿都没有获得的成功哦！"],"keywords":[{"w":"success","zh":"成功；成就","cefr":"A2","uk":"/səkˈses/","us":"/səkˈses/","ss":[["n.","成功；成就"],["n.","成功的人或事物"]]},{"w":"succeed","zh":"成功；达成目标","cefr":"A2","uk":"/səkˈsiːd/","us":"/səkˈsiːd/","ss":[["v.","成功；达成目标"],["v.","接替；继任"]]},{"w":"own","zh":"自己的","cefr":"A2","uk":"/əʊn/","us":"/oʊn/","ss":[["adj.","自己的"],["v.","拥有"]]},{"w":"lost","zh":"迷路的；丢失的","cefr":"A2","uk":"/lɒst/","us":"/lɔːst/","ss":[["adj.","迷路的；丢失的"],["adj.","困惑的；不知所措的"],["v.","丢失；失去；输掉"]]},{"w":"modern","zh":"现代的；近代的","cefr":"A2","uk":"/ˈmɒdən/","us":"/ˈmɑːdərn/","ss":[["adj.","现代的；近代的"],["adj.","新式的；时髦的"]]},{"w":"brush","zh":"刷子；画笔","cefr":"A2","uk":"/brʌʃ/","us":"/brʌʃ/","ss":[["n.","刷子；画笔"],["v.","刷；刷净"],["v.","轻擦；掠过"]]},{"w":"toothache","zh":"牙痛","cefr":"A2","uk":"/ˈtuːθeɪk/","us":"/ˈtuːθeɪk/","ss":[["n.","牙痛"]]},{"w":"disease","zh":"疾病","cefr":"A2","uk":"/dɪˈziːz/","us":"/dɪˈziːz/","ss":[["n.","疾病"]]},{"w":"calcium","zh":"钙","cefr":"B2","uk":"/ˈkælsiəm/","us":"/ˈkælsiəm/","ss":[["n.","钙"]]},{"w":"provide","zh":"提供；供应","cefr":"A2","uk":"/prəˈvaɪd/","us":"/prəˈvaɪd/","ss":[["v.","提供；供应"],["v.","供养；赡养"]]},{"w":"brush","zh":"刷子；画笔","cefr":"A2","uk":"/brʌʃ/","us":"/brʌʃ/","ss":[["n.","刷子；画笔"],["v.","刷；刷净"],["v.","轻擦；掠过"]]},{"w":"should","zh":"应该；应当","cefr":"A2","uk":"/ʃʊd/","us":"/ʃʊd/","ss":[["v.","应该；应当"],["v.","按理会；应该会"],["v.","本应该"]]},{"w":"protect","zh":"保护；防护","cefr":"A2","uk":"/prəˈtekt/","us":"/prəˈtekt/","ss":[["v.","保护；防护"]]},{"w":"able","zh":"能够的","cefr":"A2","uk":"/ˈeɪbəl/","us":"/ˈeɪbəl/","ss":[["adj.","能够的"],["adj.","能干的；有才干的"]]},{"w":"success","zh":"成功；成就","cefr":"A2","uk":"/səkˈses/","us":"/səkˈses/","ss":[["n.","成功；成就"],["n.","成功的人或事物"]]}],"kwCount":15,"level":"A2"},
